<title>UK: Core Labs bids 53p/shr for Scott Pickford.</title>
<headline>Core Labs bids 53p/shr for Scott Pickford.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.-based Core Laboratories NV said on Thursday it was offering to buy Britain's Scott Pickford Plc for 53p per share, valuing the company's share capital at about 6.7 million stg.  </p>
<p>Core said Scott Pickford's board had indicated it would recommend the offer.</p>
<p>Core Laboratories provides petroleum reservoir rock and fluids analyses, while Scott Pickford is a provider of gas reservoir management and geoscience services.</p>
<p>Scott Pickford's shares closed at 51.5p on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
